Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.88,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, thus, a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.54,0:00:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, I'm feeling alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.48,0:00:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.90,0:00:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.92,0:00:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to journey on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,On your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Camel of other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.30,0:00:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.13,0:00:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath,\NThen we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.90,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\NThen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise,\NAnd freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:14.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day,\NCause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first. I'll\Nhurt it. Be so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.88,0:01:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I could burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.79,0:01:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.34,0:01:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing. Feel it's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.54,0:01:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In a world I'm feeling\Nalive, but I'll be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.22,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.48,0:01:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.88,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,In every world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.34,0:02:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.66,0:02:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.70,0:02:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.86,0:02:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.74,0:02:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was having fun, but now\Nthey're all too chicken to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.80,0:02:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll blame them!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.24,0:02:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I am pretty awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.60,0:02:48.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, might as well knock out their\Nofficers while they're gone, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.08,0:02:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Awkward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.44,0:02:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cookie cutter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come in, Commander Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's not supposed\Nto be shaking like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.46,0:03:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.52,0:03:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It serves you right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I call that one the Drum Drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.26,0:03:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.52,0:03:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,While you morons were shooting at nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I dug a whole maze of\Ntunnels under this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.72,0:03:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,JUMPER!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.78,0:03:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all I have to do is trick\Ntheir biker buddy into -
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who put a sinkhole here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.16,0:04:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How stupid are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're telling me\Nthat was a pretty big drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You just made a super\Nmistake, short stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.48,0:04:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody off the tank?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.26,0:04:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky, why did you\Nthrow us out like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but the next form\Nhas only got one seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.38,0:04:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get freaky
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.56,0:04:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're freaky enough already
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.94,0:04:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.24,0:04:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Super Freaky!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.82,0:05:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your applause!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Brachiotak first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Headshaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.90,0:05:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Brachiotank 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.96,0:05:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Black Rhino F .R .U. 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Docking phase!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! So good! Headshaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.06,0:05:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the Iron Pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.04,0:05:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Giri, Randy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.06,0:06:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.90,0:06:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd rather get a giant fighting robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I still haven't met the\Nmad genius Vegapunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.12,0:06:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but I finally made his dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.64,0:06:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it did take a whole\Ntwo years of trial and error,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,By manipulating the shaped memory\Nalloy known as waffle metal,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've built a big-ass robot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.54,0:06:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a bucket of foam!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.95,0:07:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.86,0:07:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just getting started, bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.18,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This thing is called\Nthe Plunderer's Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.72,0:07:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a sword, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.22,0:07:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.56,0:07:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your step!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.94,0:07:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sweating low!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You whims can jump up\Nand down all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll blast you\Nstraight out of the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.64,0:07:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.55,0:07:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want shoulder cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not what I was expecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.58,0:08:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But hey... Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.86,0:08:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still cool, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.78,0:08:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn this guy. What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:20.44,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wings!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.32,0:08:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Franky! You're a boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks lame to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.40,0:08:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you must be one of\Nthe weaker ones, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who says I'm weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.46,0:08:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I just like it when other\Npeople do all the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorcery Climb Attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This one is gonna blow you away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for the Gusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I learned that back in Weatheria.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.82,0:09:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's hardcore meteorology.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.66,0:09:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now who's weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, where's Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get that guy over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, guess I'm\Nofficially off the tank now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.66,0:09:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I've got to fight by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.82,0:09:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.10,0:09:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not some little\Nweenie like I was before!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.20,0:09:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Special attack, Greenside!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Bamboo Javelin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're proud, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.94,0:10:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget those two crazy years I
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.36,0:10:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,spent training with you\Nin the swindling forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the next chapter of life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.44,0:10:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The legend of the great hero Usopp\Nis beginning right here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna dig sinkholes\Nall over this plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter how powerful\Nthat ridiculous robot is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If he drives into a\Nhole then it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.76,0:10:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like someone else is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.72,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He shot straight out of the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Look close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can dig holes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.22,0:11:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My horn point really came in handy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.72,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you can turn into a big\Nhairy bug and you never told me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.46,0:11:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that is so rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.38,0:11:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.90,0:11:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent the last two years working on\Nall seven of my transformation points.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm so good that I only need\Nthe rumble ball for one of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So I can use all my other\Nforms whenever I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.58,0:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You coral head pain in the ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so gonna bite you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.18,0:11:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not coral, they're\Nhorns like a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And you are about to see\Nwhat this monster can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.22,0:12:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How many have we killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.62,0:12:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a single one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.66,0:12:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you did to gain Straw\NHat's trust, but that doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.44,0:12:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You might salvage this yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got the princess where I want her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now squeeze the life out of her, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.86,0:12:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you perhaps forget your\Nbrother at the North Pole?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where he is right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My men and I can go there and\Nslaughter him any time we please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't mind killing\Nyou or your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The corpses of mythical\Nbeasts are quite valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But that won't be a problem\Nbecause you're on my side, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:12:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.08,0:13:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So the Kraken agreed to do Hordy's breading\Nto ensure the safety of his brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.76,0:13:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I said squeeze that mermaid to death now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.42,0:13:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Tsurume, stop\Nit. You're hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.46,0:13:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsurume!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to save your brother's life,\NSo you did whatever this jerk told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.52,0:13:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what that's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.88,0:14:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, is he your big brother\Nor your little brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,If you need someone to\Nsave him, then count on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.12,0:14:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just ask next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.96,0:14:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, we're friends, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.16,0:14:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming this way. Let's get
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.68,0:14:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're no match for our\Nleader. Leave this one to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.38,0:14:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't let you get one\Nstep closer to our captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.08,0:14:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.96,0:14:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You go through me first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.68,0:15:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.62,0:15:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, second gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:16:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the ship of promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is doing this and how?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.44,0:16:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a terrible development.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must forgive my ignorance,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,father, but I don't understand why\Nyou're so upset by its presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I do admit that it's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.98,0:16:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship itself is\Nnothing more than a relic.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.60,0:16:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It has no purpose today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.46,0:16:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.72,0:16:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to have\Nanything happen to that ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.30,0:16:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, my son, until the intended day,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.96,0:16:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,that vessel was not to be\Nmoved from its resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.84,0:17:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.88,0:17:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought after he took all those energy\Nsteroids, nothing could stand up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.54,0:17:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.66,0:17:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Little bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.74,0:17:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we got back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.64,0:17:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.14,0:17:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My face, my karate will end you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He knocked his head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And all it took was a single blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess you forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.40,0:17:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm made of rubber!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.18,0:17:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that it matters with a punch that\Nweak, you're nothing compared to Jinbe!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.86,0:17:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course he's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.22,0:17:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Rather than improve, he\Nrelies on false strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.72,0:17:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for head hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.66,0:17:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Higher chill squad, form up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.60,0:17:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.10,0:17:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Your head's gonna split wide open!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't be so sure about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bum-Bum-Bum!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He just gets at their\Nshields with his face!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.20,0:18:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Can he see into the future or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish he would teach me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.40,0:19:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using observation Haki.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've done more than\Nenough dancing around for one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.74,0:19:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,GONG GONG MULLET!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.02,0:19:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so small but so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:19:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen pirates before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.82,0:20:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,None of them could do stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.82,0:20:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.46,0:20:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.37,0:20:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,it can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the Noah from the Fishman District!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it flying above the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If you ask me, it looks like\Nit's going to the plaza.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.90,0:20:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost broken through the\Nbubble protecting the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.92,0:20:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once that thing pops,\Nwe're all goners for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.62,0:20:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be sent to watery graves!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.98,0:20:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna fill me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.54,0:20:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing is super gigantic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.84,0:20:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If that ship hits us, the island\Nisn't gonna stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.44,0:20:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever's operating it needs to pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have an engine!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.14,0:20:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no way that this will\Nend well for us! It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead for sure this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In our last moments, I\Ncan't help but wonder,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,will our blood be enough\Nto stain the sea red?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.18,0:21:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you not say morbid\Nthings like that right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a break for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.10,0:21:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get into the water while you can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.22,0:21:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I gotta be so clumsy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of Vander\NDecken's men. Watatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Decken, can you hear me up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.56,0:22:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I fell off to knowing I can't get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.74,0:22:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to stop that ship for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.54,0:22:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.78,0:22:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Deccan's behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.30,0:22:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Captain Hardy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.28,0:22:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.08,0:22:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I'm curious if this is\Na part of your plan, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.68,0:22:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it could be because Deccan\Nis controlling the ship, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.10,0:22:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm busy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.38,0:22:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.72,0:22:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, Straw Hat. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.00,0:22:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I really didn't think you'd\Nget back up after that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this guy's no joke after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.38,0:22:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he out of his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.12,0:22:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is Deccan thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.34,0:22:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That bastard is about to\Nruin all my hard work!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I am offering my love one last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.14,0:23:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the dick away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I not die?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.34,0:23:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.10,0:23:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have thought about\Nnot dying before you fell off.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.96,0:23:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Them's the brakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.20,0:23:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just one more thing I have to\Nsacrifice in my pursuit of Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.64,0:23:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is this happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.46,0:23:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The bubble's about to pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.26,0:23:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doomed for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.70,0:24:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey where did princess Shirahoshi go?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.60,0:24:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She vanished this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it good, princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.18,0:24:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Please you have to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.02,0:24:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.22,0:24:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,My Shirahoshi has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.12,0:24:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.62,0:24:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shirahoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.18,0:24:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When'd she get up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.68,0:24:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.60,0:24:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.78,0:24:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.46,0:24:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's changing the ship's trajectory\Nby moving herself away from the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.90,0:24:33.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.96,0:24:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's exactly what I'd\Nexpect from my dream girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.10,0:24:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.02,0:24:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I never believed you\Nwould stoop this low!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.54,0:24:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.45,0:24:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to take my life,\Nthen I am powerless to stop you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.24,0:24:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one else should have to suffer!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.46,0:24:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you harm this kingdom!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.58,0:24:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect it with my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:24:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So come get me, you monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.50,0:24:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.06,0:25:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.22,0:25:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.13,0:25:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I get for\Nteaming up with a madman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.84,0:25:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I expected he might kill a few commoners,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.46,0:25:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I see he just\Nas soon killed me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.08,0:25:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.99,0:25:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stand for betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.86,0:25:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.86,0:25:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't sacrifice yourself for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.04,0:25:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to do something to save her!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.24,0:25:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Lovely!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.15,0:25:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Your beauty is so much\Nmore than skin teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.40,0:25:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Faced with impossible odds,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.06,0:25:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you take matters into your own hands\Nto save the countless citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.26,0:25:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope to crash for no good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.70,0:25:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.22,0:25:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a whole day!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.58,0:25:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.14,0:26:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As I always suspected,\Nyou are the perfect woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.18,0:26:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,to become Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.54,0:26:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanderdeck in the ninth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.92,0:26:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you insist on rejecting me,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.56,0:26:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear your beauty must\Nbe resigned to history.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.86,0:26:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.40,0:26:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.36,0:26:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Hachi!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.06,0:26:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to stay\Nwhere I can protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.56,0:26:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.26,0:26:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.90,0:26:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.36,0:26:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did the captain run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.70,0:26:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.86,0:26:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's on that chain!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.04,0:26:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's making a break for Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.40,0:27:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what happens\Nto trainers, Fandertekin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.62,0:27:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But I do admit, I like\Nthis idea, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.08,0:27:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.99,0:27:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make him pay for\Nhurting the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Saint, hold it! I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.08,0:27:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You take care of the plaza!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.16,0:27:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.20,0:27:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.12,0:27:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Put the ship's in a bubble,\Nso it should be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.86,0:27:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That would make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.60,0:27:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Deccan is weak to seawater, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.52,0:27:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite being a fish man, he\Nneeds air to move around freely.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.26,0:27:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Better safe than sorry, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.28,0:27:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this bubbly coral.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.90,0:28:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.38,0:28:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I'm\Nletting you save the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.58,0:28:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not let us down!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.38,0:28:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold anything back, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.80,0:28:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
